1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:05,170 --> 00:02:06,530
Damn it,

25
00:02:06,610 --> 00:02:08,120
the Return Cauldron malfunctioned

26
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,330
and sent us to the moon !

27
00:02:09,330 --> 00:02:11,330
Fortunately we're back now.

28
00:02:12,090 --> 00:02:12,970
Fellow cultivator,

29
00:02:12,970 --> 00:02:16,000
has anything major happened on planet Suzaku lately ?

30
00:02:16,330 --> 00:02:19,320
The biggest thing is, of course, the person named Ceng Niu.

31
00:02:19,810 --> 00:02:20,800
Ceng Niu ?

32
00:02:21,410 --> 00:02:23,050
Yes, Ceng Niu.

33
00:02:23,130 --> 00:02:25,570
Red Butterfly lost an arm because of him !

34
00:02:25,970 --> 00:02:28,000
What does this Ceng Niu look like ?

35
00:02:29,690 --> 00:02:30,560
Senior,

36
00:02:30,730 --> 00:02:32,800
Junior doesn't know anything.

37
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:36,920
The country of Suzaku hasn't released any news about him either.

38
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:39,520
They didn't put a bounty on my head ?

39
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,000
Something fishy is going on.

40
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:44,560
Little girl is honest and smart,

41
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:45,840
not bad.

42
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:49,560
This bottle of pills will help you reach Core Formation.

43
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,280
Shattered Earth Pill !?

44
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:06,600
Disciple, you have great fortune !

45
00:03:07,320 --> 00:03:08,120
Is that so ?

46
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,480
It's been a long time

47
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:12,280
and I don't know what happened to Wan'er.

48
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,880
It's time to go home.

49
00:03:19,490 --> 00:03:22,610
Qingtian Sect\NCountry of Chu's border

50
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,090
What's going on ?

51
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:30,040
Enemy attack !

52
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:32,240
What kind of monsters are they ?

53
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,960
You guys are still hungry, right ?

54
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:38,320
We've only eaten 12 sects.

55
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:40,840
The trip to the Celestial Realm was too expensive,

56
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:43,480
let's recover by eating the country of Chu !

57
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:52,160
Maiwu Yi\NQingtian Sect Leader\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul

58
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:55,160
Chu is a vassal of the Giant Demon Clan.

59
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,280
Lord Envoy

60
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:05,360
won't forgive you for this !

61
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:09,040
Lord Envoy ?

62
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:14,440
Giant Demon Clan Envoy\NSoul Formation

63
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:11,720
Heaven's Tower\NCountry of Chu

64
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:11,320
It's him !

65
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,400
According to the Elders of the clan,

66
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:15,760
although he's only Early stage Soul Formation.

67
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:18,800
He is one of the 6 cultivators of Suzaku who went to the Celestial Realm.

68
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:19,960
He isn't simple.

69
00:04:27,750 --> 00:04:29,350
Zhan Bai of the Insect Demon Sect,

70
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,400
you deceived your master

71
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:31,880
and stole your sect's sacred texts !

72
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,880
You are wanted by the country of Puli !

73
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,440
I advise you to leave quickly !

74
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,680
Otherwise, once it's known that you're here,

75
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,000
they will come to kill you !

76
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:44,720
A Soul Formation cultivator

77
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:49,280
will be much more nourishing than Core Formations or Nascent Souls...

78
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,520
Madman !

79
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:09,840
It's a pity...

80
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:12,640
I didn't get to eat him.

81
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:16,760
This trip to the Celestial Realm was humiliating !

82
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:20,080
If it weren't for that Ceng Niu,

83
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:22,600
I wouldn't be in such a sorry state !

84
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:24,440
I should've been the one

85
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,840
to become famous !

86
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:27,240
However,

87
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:29,640
since he cut off Red Butterfly's arm,

88
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:33,400
I'm sure he's not Early stage Soul Formation.

89
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,160
He isn't to be messed with

90
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:39,040
before I have a breakthrough.

91
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:02,680
Sect Leader,

92
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:04,080
your health is important.

93
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:07,360
Playing the zither is a strain on your mind.

94
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:11,080
Did you find where that person comes from ?

95
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,920
I just know he's not very old.

96
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,400
A month ago,

97
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:17,880
he appeared at the border of Chu

98
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:20,800
and destroyed 12 sects in 7 days,

99
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,550
killing Nascent Soul Elders in the process.

100
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:26,560
I don't know who his next target will be.

101
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:33,880
In a few days,

102
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,160
when I’m feeling better,

103
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:38,920
I will return your Soul Blood.

104
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:39,960
Sect Leader !

105
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:42,800
All of you should run away afterward.

106
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:46,560
If only Ceng Niu could come to our country,

107
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:48,340
then this disaster would be resolved.

108
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:50,120
Ceng Niu

109
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:54,280
probably hasn’t even heard of Chu.

110
00:06:56,760 --> 00:06:57,760
The Cloud Sky Sect

111
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:01,200
won't be able to avoid this disaster.

112
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:07,410
In these past 100 years, she failed at Nascent Soul 3 times

113
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:09,000
despite taking many pills.

114
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:13,720
If it wasn’t for the fact that she wanted to see that person one more time,

115
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:16,920
she would have died 30 years ago

116
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:19,320
when she failed to breakthrough again…

117
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:26,080
The foreign cultivator is going to wipe out the country of Chu.

118
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,680
Even the Giant Demon Clan don't dare to intervene.

119
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:31,200
Even if he was here,

120
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:35,400
I'm afraid he wouldn't be able to save the Cloud Sky Sect.

121
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,680
Chu has many factions.

122
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:40,800
The Cloud Sky Sect is not safe.

123
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:41,760
You...

124
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:45,520
Wan'er has been in the Cloud Sky Sect for a long time

125
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:47,960
so I can take care of these things myself.

126
00:07:48,170 --> 00:07:50,830
Note: This part was cut from episode 44.

127
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:51,880
This is...

128
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:53,520
A devil I raised,

129
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:54,920
you can call it out

130
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,560
with a single thought.

131
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:07,480
From now on,

132
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:09,920
you must protect Wan'er at all times.

133
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:14,560
From now on, I'll call you Little Ling.

134
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,040
Senior...

135
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:24,760
Little Ling,

136
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,680
when will

137
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:31,120
your master come back ?

138
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,520
I haven't seen Wan'er in a while,

139
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:43,400
I should buy something for her...

140
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:49,360
Treasure Refining Pavilion\NSea of Devils\NDevil Rebel City

141
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,600
Treasure Refining Pavilion

142
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:51,880
Welcome Sir,

143
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:54,360
what would you like to buy ?

144
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:55,560
A pill recipe,

145
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:56,600
at least grade 5.

146
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:02,050
Grade 5 pills recipes are very expensive.

147
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:03,920
Our pavilion only has 3.

148
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,240
Please wait here,

149
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:07,720
I'll get them for you.

150
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:09,320
Yes that's right...

151
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,360
Sir,

152
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:13,330
we have 3 grade 5 pill recipes.

153
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,460
2 of them.

154
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:16,520
are from Chu's Cloud Sky Sect.

155
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:20,280
And the other one is from Da Mo’s End of the World Sect.

156
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:23,000
They are all top quality pill recipes.

157
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:25,150
These jades contain the effect of the pills.

158
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,000
Please have a look.

159
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,000
No need.

160
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:30,280
I want this pill recipe from the End of the World Sect.

161
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:31,640
Do you have any

162
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,200
grade 6 pill recipes ?

163
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,560
A grade 6 pill recipe

164
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:38,400
is a priceless item.

165
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:40,360
My Treasure Refining Pavilion only has one.

166
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:42,120
But this item,

167
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:45,560
will be sold at the Sea of Devils auction that happens every 10 years.

168
00:09:46,040 --> 00:09:48,520
If Sir wants it, why don't you wait 2 months ?

169
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:50,520
The auction is in 2 months.

170
00:09:50,640 --> 00:09:51,440
Nevermind.

171
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:52,960
How much for this one ?

172
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:56,160
Sir, do you want to exchange items

173
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:57,320
or buy with spirit stones ?

174
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,240
Spirit stones.

175
00:09:58,680 --> 00:10:00,120
This...

176
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:03,560
Items that have reached a certain value

177
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:06,440
are not sold for spirit stones.

178
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,280
Sir !

179
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:22,280
Sh...Shopkeeper...

180
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:32,080
This is...

181
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:33,960
a top-quality spirit stone !

182
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:40,000
Luoyue Sect\NCountry of Chu

183
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:54,280
This food is tasteless.

184
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:57,560
I heard that the biggest sect in Chu

185
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:00,080
has a beauty as the Sect Leader.

186
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:01,440
What was its name ?

187
00:11:02,760 --> 00:11:04,040
Cloud Sky Sect ?

188
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:10,000
I'd like to see

189
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:12,480
that beauty get devoured by insects.

190
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:14,840
What could be more beautiful ?

191
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:20,200
How dare you do this to the country of Chu ?

192
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:22,600
Don't you know that Wang Lin from the Cloud Sky Sect

193
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:24,200
won't forgive you !?

194
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,080
Wang Lin ?

195
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,480
Never heard of him.

196
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:38,760
Only a handful of Soul Formation cultivators can fight me,

197
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:43,520
the rest are just meat on my plate.

198
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:55,080
The newly opened Chen's Tavern

199
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,960
sells 20% off !

200
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:58,640
Did you hear

201
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:01,520
that a mysterious person appeared in the Sea of Devils.

202
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:03,400
He bought a pill recipe at a high price.

203
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:06,200
The store was about to throw him out

204
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:07,640
but he forcefully took the item

205
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:09,880
and still paid them.

206
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,840
He went to many shops of the Sea of Devils

207
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:15,120
where there's no shortage of Nascent Souls.

208
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:16,600
Nascent Soul ?

209
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:17,920
I'm shocked !

210
00:12:20,400 --> 00:12:21,360
Congratulations, Master.

211
00:12:21,520 --> 00:12:24,120
In 10 days, you have purchased 8 grade 5 pill recipes !

212
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:26,240
If Wan'er sees these,

213
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:27,920
she will be happy.

214
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:30,040
Country of Chu...

215
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,320
I'm finally back.

216
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:37,520
This is...

217
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:40,240
An inner demon ?!

218
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,440
Not possible.

219
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:42,680
With my cultivation,

220
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:45,680
a normal inner demon could never enter my Origin Soul.

221
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:50,800
I will kill you !

222
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,040
This battle will be dangerous.

223
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:07,840
Those who want to leave are free to go.

224
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:10,160
If it weren't for Sect Leader's help,

225
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:12,560
I would never have reached Nascent Soul.

226
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:13,920
In this difficult time,

227
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:16,760
there is no reason to abandon you.

228
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:19,880
I swear to stand by your side !

229
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,760
It's thanks to Sect Leader

230
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:25,760
that the Cloud Sky Sect has more than 10 Nascent Soul cultivators.

231
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:27,640
We are indebted to you.

232
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:30,520
Today, I swear to protect Sect Leader.

233
00:13:30,800 --> 00:13:33,280
I will never let Sect Leader down.

234
00:13:33,760 --> 00:13:35,280
We will follow you until death !

235
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:37,280
We will follow you until death !

236
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:39,200
We will follow you until death !

237
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,920
Listen well, Cloud Sky Sect.

238
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:54,880
Bring out all your pills

239
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:57,410
and your Sect Leader is to come out

240
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:59,840
to greet me personally.

241
00:14:00,880 --> 00:14:02,920
Senior is a Soul Formation cultivator,

242
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:05,430
please don’t make it difficult for a small sect like ours.

243
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:07,120
If Senior needs any pills,

244
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:08,860
you can just ask us.

245
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:11,480
My Cloud Sky Sect will do its best to fulfill your needs.

246
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,800
I guess you are the Sect Leader.

247
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,960
Give me the pills !

248
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:22,440
This formation is mysterious.

249
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:23,240
Senior,

250
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:26,120
this formation was placed up by the Giant Demon Clan

251
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:27,080
to protect my sect.

252
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:29,320
Consider giving the Giant Demon Clan some face

253
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:31,040
and don't make it difficult for us.

254
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:33,800
The Giant Demon Clan ?

255
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:43,520
You might as well call them now.

256
00:14:44,040 --> 00:14:47,880
Let's see if young master Chi Hu comes himself to save you !

257
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:54,060
The Cloud Sky Formation

258
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,240
won't hold for long.

259
00:14:57,640 --> 00:14:58,640
I will do my best !

260
00:15:18,280 --> 00:15:19,080
Protect the disciples

261
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,080
with all your might !

262
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:27,080
The disciples will retreat first !

263
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:27,760
Yes !

264
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:31,880
Hurry, retreat !

265
00:15:41,760 --> 00:15:43,680
You really are a beauty...

266
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:48,040
You must taste very good.

267
00:15:48,760 --> 00:15:50,280
What's your name ?

268
00:15:52,660 --> 00:15:54,520
Oh? Not going to speak ?

269
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:55,600
That’s too bad !

270
00:15:56,760 --> 00:15:57,600
What the hell !?

271
00:15:59,880 --> 00:16:00,480
Stop !

272
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:01,760
My name is Li Muwan !

273
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:06,880
Senior,

274
00:16:07,280 --> 00:16:09,200
if you have any request, please speak.

275
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:10,680
My request ?

276
00:16:10,910 --> 00:16:12,000
I’m going to kill you all,

277
00:16:12,160 --> 00:16:13,520
take all the pills,

278
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:16,040
and seal this place to be my personal palace.

279
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:19,960
As for you, you can be my maid.

280
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:22,280
You went too far !

281
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:35,160
It looks like I was too kind.

282
00:16:39,800 --> 00:16:40,640
What the hell !?

283
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:49,800
Cloud Sky Sect...

284
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:50,920
Break !

285
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:54,920
Sect Leader, be careful !

286
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:58,120
No !

287
00:17:22,080 --> 00:17:24,480
You've got a few tricks up your sleeve...

288
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:33,160
Senior,

289
00:17:33,600 --> 00:17:36,800
I don't think Wan'er can wait for you anymore.

290
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:38,640
With your cultivation,

291
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:42,720
how did you get the position of Cloud Sky Sect Leader ?

292
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:48,240
Because

293
00:17:49,600 --> 00:17:51,400
she is my woman.

294
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,520
Ceng Niu !?

295
00:18:13,860 --> 00:20:44,210
The following scene was changed in the donghua. In the novel, Wang Lin is anxious to meet Li Muwan again and confuses that feeling of love with an inner demon disturbing his cultivation. In the donghua, they adapted the scene as if he was sensing danger through the Divine Sense he left with Li Muwan.\N\NWang Lin didn’t stop at all during this 800 000 li trip.\NHe stood on the edge of the Sea of Devils looking toward Chu, and for some reason his heart trembled slightly. He had never felt it trembling like this before; this was the first time it ever happened.\N“Inner demon ? Not possible. With my cultivation, a normal inner demon could never enter my Origin Soul.” While Wang Lin thought about it, he walked into the Sea of Devils.\N“I haven’t seen Wan Er in many years. I should buy something for her… ” Wang Lin let out a faint smile.

296
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:32,760
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust\Nlike water without a source.

297
00:18:32,830 --> 00:18:38,920
Like the difference between clouds and mud,\Nthe truth cannot be found in conflict.

298
00:18:39,030 --> 00:18:42,860
Life and death\Nare like the moment when the rain falls

299
00:18:42,890 --> 00:18:46,790
and like many other unseparable things.

300
00:18:47,150 --> 00:18:52,800
In this lifetime,\Nto cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

301
00:18:53,980 --> 00:18:59,810
Old grudges had to be settled\Nbecause half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

302
00:19:00,120 --> 00:19:05,660
Use the most vivid love and hate\Nto ask questions to your fate.

303
00:19:06,120 --> 00:19:10,340
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage\Nto pierce the heart and the soul

304
00:19:10,600 --> 00:19:13,830
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

305
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:19,820
Only when you bend down can you understand\Nthe hidden edge of the blade.

306
00:19:20,340 --> 00:19:24,020
The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.

307
00:19:24,120 --> 00:19:27,940
Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.

308
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:33,790
Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.

309
00:19:34,050 --> 00:19:37,720
One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

310
00:19:37,930 --> 00:19:41,500
One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

311
00:19:41,620 --> 00:19:47,540
Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.

